{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsfoundations\/swift\/dictionary\/subscript(orkey:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/Swift\/Dictionary\/subscript(orKey:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations","doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/Swift","doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/Swift\/Dictionary"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"If there is no value for the given "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"key"},{"type":"text","text":", returns the description of this key,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"i.e.font family name without the font weight in the end and without whitespaces."}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"orKey"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"key"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Key"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"key","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The key to use to get a value"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In fact if it seems some rules are missing, or weight are not managed, if the font family only is returned","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the user has an higher probability to use the expected font. Because if a mashup of family name and weight is returned","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it can produce a PostScript identifier not available, so not usable, so implying a fallback to default system font like ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"San Francisco"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Because PostScript identifiers in most of cases do not have whitespaces, remove them.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ Given a dictionary with one value","    let myDict: PostScriptFontNamesMap = [PSFNMK(\"Arial\", Font.Weight.bold): \"Aria-BoldMT\"]","","    \/\/ The given value is returned if the key exists","    let keyExists = myDict[PSFNMK(\"Arial\", Font.Weight.bold)] \/\/ Arial-BoldMT","","    \/\/ But if the key does not exist, the only the key is returned","    let keyDoesNotExist = myDict[PSFNMK(\"Luciole\", Font.Weight.bold)] \/\/ Luciole"]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"title":"subscript(orKey:)","modules":[{"relatedModules":["Swift"],"name":"Foundations"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Subscript","symbolKind":"subscript","externalID":"s:SD15OUDSFoundationsAA25PostScriptFontNamesMapKeyVRszSSRs_rlE02orG0SSAC_tcip","role":"symbol","conformance":{"conformancePrefix":[{"text":"Conforms when","type":"text"}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"text":"Available when","type":"text"}],"constraints":[{"code":"Key","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"PostScriptFontNamesMapKey","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"Value","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"String","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},"extendedModule":"Swift","fragments":[{"text":"subscript","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"orKey","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" _: ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Key","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"}]},"references":{"doc://OU